sequenceDiagram
 actor P as Patient
 participant UI as Web frontend
 participant AI as AISchedulingAdapter
 participant L as Language model API
 participant V as AvailabilityService
 P->>UI: Request AI scheduling help
 UI->>AI: suggest(patientId, text)
 AI->>L: Interpret scheduling preferences
 alt No response within 8 seconds
  AI-->>UI: timeout, use manual search
 else Service error or malformed response
  L-->>AI: error or invalid payload
  AI-->>UI: unavailable, use manual search
 end
 UI-->>P: Show provider and date controls
 P->>UI: Select preferences manually
 UI->>V: findOpen(manualIntent)
 V-->>UI: real available slots
 UI-->>P: Display slots, await confirmation
 Note over AI,V: AI failure does not create or change an appointment
